Redux is a state management library usually used with React.js but can also work with Angular,Vue or even Plain JS
->It handles Complex state management system
-> It Relies on a single immutable object(Once it is created,its contents cannot be changed) to store all the application state kind of like a client-side database to change the state when a button is clicked an action will be dispatched which has a name like an event and a payload with the data that it wants to change  
